# Build state belongs on grey-subdevice, never on Crate or in Git.
out/
work/
logs/
releases/
artifacts/
*.img
*.img.xz
*.zst
SHA256SUMS

# Published project documentation is tracked.  Scratch Markdown can live
# outside this repository; hiding docs here made README links silently rot.
!README.md
!docs/*.md
config/local.env
